            <h1>
              {t('아름답게, 강력하게.', 'Beautiful. Powerful.')}<br />{' '}
              <span>{t('React로 자연스럽게.', 'Naturally React.')}</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-description">
              <strong>{t('대용량 가상화부터 실무에 필요한 데이터 기능까지.', 'From large-scale virtualization to essential business data features.')}</strong>
              <span>{t('복잡한 비즈니스 UI를 빠르고 유연하게 구축하는 오픈소스 React Data Grid입니다.', 'An open-source React Data Grid for building complex business UIs quickly and flexibly.')}</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-actions-container">
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a href={localizePath('/learn/getting-started', locale)} class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Get Started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
              <a href={productFacts.repositoryUrl} class="btn btn-secondary btn-large" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
            </div>
            <p class="install-caption">{t('설치하고 바로 시작하세요.', 'Install and start building in minutes.')}</p>
            <div class="install-command" aria-label={t('npm 설치 명령', 'npm installation command')}>
              <span class="install-prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
              <code>npm i {productFacts.packageName}</code>
              <button type="button" class="copy-command" data-copy-command data-copy-ready={t('복사', 'Copy')} data-copy-success={t('복사됨', 'Copied')} aria-label={t('설치 명령 복사', 'Copy installation command')}>{t('복사', 'Copy')}</button>
            </div>
            <p class="hero-trust-note">
              <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              {t('Apache-2.0 오픈소스 · 모든 기능을 실행 예제와 실제 소스로 확인하세요.', 'Apache-2.0 open source · Verify every feature with runnable examples and real source.')}
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual" aria-label={t('직접 편집하고 정렬할 수 있는 주문 데이터 그리드', 'Editable and sortable order DataGrid')}>
